  "bullets": [
    "Flying demand: est. organ-miles roughly flat (+0.1%) YTD: volume +4.4%, but est. avg distance \u22124.2% (lung \u22127.0%, liver \u22122.9%, heart \u22121.3%).",
    "Volumes: Heart + liver + lung (Strata's core flying organs) rose 0.8% over the last 4 weeks vs. last year; by organ, heart and lung fell 4.7% and 7.8%; liver rose 5.9%; kidney was roughly flat (-1.8%).",
    "Quarter: Q3 heart+liver+lung \u25b2 5.2% YoY; \u25bc 5.8% vs Q2 (typical Q2\u2192Q3: \u25bc 4.2%).",
    "Donors: Deceased donors recovered rose 6.3% over the last 4 weeks vs. last year, and 20.5% of recovered organs have been discarded so far this year (19.7% a year earlier). DCD donors are 53.5% of deceased donors so far this year, up from 49.2% in 2025.",
    "Waitlist: Heart+liver+lung waitlist additions rose (+4.6%) over the last 4 weeks vs. last year; by organ, heart, liver and lung rose 2.4%, 5.2% and 5.0%; kidney fell 4.7%.",
